    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The CoVe method consists of four core steps: (1) generating a <strong>baseline response</strong> to the user's query, (2) planning <strong>verification questions</strong> to check the response, (3) <strong>executing the verification questions</strong> to assess the response's accuracy, and (4) generating a <strong>final verified response</strong> based on the verification results. Each step is performed by prompting the same language model in different ways to obtain the desired response.",
