    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Experiments demonstrate that CoVe reduces hallucinations across various tasks, including list-based questions, closed-book QA, and longform text generation. The results show that CoVe improves precision, F1 score, and FACT SCORE metrics compared to baseline models. Additionally, the factored CoVe approach, which separates the verification chain steps, outperforms the joint approach and achieves state-of-the-art results.",
